 CPU core operating at a maximum frequency of 72MHz. It functions within a wide supply voltage range of 2V to 3.6V and handles operating temperatures from -40°C to +85°C."},{"question":"How Do I Handle the Debugging and Programming Implementation for This Chip?","answer":"System implementation and software flashing are highly straightforward, as the MCU fully integrates built-in Serial Wire Debug (SWD) and JTAG interfaces for real-time debugging and testing."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/ac66debd4c13334db1d28037926f8881.pdf?productCode=C8734","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj399828","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证(英文版)_ST(意法半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/9553356917c3ad68e308019f11587e30.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1478402","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证(英文版)_ST(意法半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/030fa2248f0ae1184de9ec04fd5926b8.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1866126","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_ST(意法半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/2e353b4888baee8c4f4f7c0d22e42052.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1586190","fileName":"STM32F103C8T6_ROHS认证(英文版)_ST(意法半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/e0fb52a31496883020f5e3c7af6d756d.pdf"}],"productDescEn":null,"productIntroEn":"ARM Cortex-M3 32 Bit 72MHz LQFP-48(7x7) Microcontrollers RoHS","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_31018_n","paramName":"ADC(位数)","paramNameEn":"ADC (Bit)","paramValue":"12bit","paramValueEn":"12bit","paramValueEnForSearch":12.0,"isMain":false,"sortNumber":1,"sort":42},{"paramCode":"param_31017_n","paramName":"I/O数量","paramNameEn":"Number of I/O","paramValue":"37","paramValueEn":"37","paramValueEnForSearch":37.0,"isMain":false,"sortNumber":1,"sort":39},{"paramCode":"param_31030_st","paramName":"工作温度","paramNameEn":"Operating Temperature","paramValue":"-40℃~+85℃","paramValueEn":"-40℃~+85℃","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":false,"sortNumber":1